+### 7.4 Vacuity mutation and saturation control
+
+For the passing cubic shear take `x=z^-3` and roots
+
+```text
+-z^-1,
+(1+sqrt(3)I)z^-1/2,
+(1-sqrt(3)I)z^-1/2.
+```
+
+Mutate only the first tame coefficient:
+
+```text
+tau_0 -> -z^-1+a,       tau_1,tau_2 unchanged.
+```
