+Thus the mutation fails at `z^3=t^1`.  To prevent the nominal mutation
+`a=0` from masquerading as a negative test, the wrapper declares the exact
+ring and Rabinowitsch localization
+
+```text
+ring:  QQ[a,sat_witness], lex(a,sat_witness)
+ideal: <a/3, sat_witness*a-1>.
+```
