+No result is typed `RANK-EXCESS`: an ambient generic rank away from the target
+variety would not supply componentwise codimension.  No result is typed
+`SATURATED-EMPTY`: the localized ideal was not formed.  No result is typed
+`SURVIVES-TO-Q`: absence of a test is not passage through a test.
