+| A | 10 | 20 | 40 | 35 | -5 | no |
+| A | 11 | 22 | 44 | 35 | -9 | no |
+| A | 12 | 24 | 48 | 35 | -13 | no |
+| B | 9 | 13 | 26 | 35 | 9 | yes |
+| C | 9 | 17 | 34 | 35 | 1 | yes, the razor |
+
+This table is `COUNTING-BOUND` in the restricted model.  It is not even an
+intrinsic count for the complete system: orbit covariance can identify local
+coordinates, while centre, outer, minor, and shared-junction variables can
+add coordinates.  POLY can also add rows.  Only a decoration decides the net
+effect.
+
+The requested decoration/status table is:
+
+| group | `k` | `UNI` input status | `SPLIT` input status | global `U(4.13)` | global `C(4.11)` | global rank | global cokernel | saturated ideal / EMPTY | typed result |
+|---|---:|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| A | 12 | assumed one disc orbit; permutation/route missing | no supplied split | not computed | not computed | not computed | not computed | not formed | `COUNTING-BOUND` |
+| A | 14 | assumed one disc orbit; permutation/route missing | no supplied split | not computed | not computed | not computed | not computed | not formed | `COUNTING-BOUND` |
+| A | 16 | assumed one disc orbit; permutation/route missing | no supplied split | not computed | not computed | not computed | not computed | not formed | `COUNTING-BOUND` |
+| A | 18 | assumed one disc orbit; `k=A_2` only numerically | no supplied split | not computed | not computed | not computed | not computed | not formed | `COUNTING-BOUND` |
