+# D105-RANK-GATE — preflight, forced partial data, and the missing global matrix
+
+**Lane/date.** `D105-RANK-GATE`, 2026-09-03.  **Status of new work:**
+`PROVED-HERE / UNREVIEWED` unless a narrower type is printed.  No canonical
+ledger was edited and `jc2-lean` was not inspected.
+
+## 0. Executive verdict
+
+The requested global ranks, cokernels, and saturated ideals are **not defined
+by the charged inputs**.  I therefore do not report a fabricated rank for any
+of the three true `D=105` groups.
+
+The obstruction is concrete.  Section 4.1 of the sealed framework requires a
+rooted tree on all 105 labelled roots, a checked cyclic action on those roots,
+every root's truncated Puiseux series, the sharing relations among tame
+coefficients, and a precision guard.  The census supplies a representative
+Moh chain and a capacity for bottom discs.  The reviewed star supplies the
+three relative leading coefficients `{-1,0,1}` inside one bottom disc.  It does
+not supply the other roots, the disc centres, their contacts, their tail
+support, or their sharing.  Those missing quantities occur in the first
+global moment matrix itself.
+
+There are nevertheless four exact outputs.
+
+1. The three chains, radii, denominator increments, representative cluster
+   sizes, minimal junction orders, and normalized Jacobian constants are
+   reconstructed exactly.
+2. The denominator increments give order-`A_2=18,13,17` orbits of nonzero
+   **factors of the local cover polynomial `p(pi)`**.  They do not identify
+   those factors with physical bottom discs or global fibre branches.  Thus
+   they neither validate nor invalidate any requested `k`-disc `UNI` packet;
+   all nine `UNI` actions and all nine `SPLIT` actions still need
+   route-to-tree data.
+3. At the `D_2` gap, the exact restricted one-disc operator has rank 5,
+   kernel dimension 2, and cokernel dimension 0 for every group.  This
+   verifies the local source of GPT-5.5's `2k` count.  It does not construct
+   the 35-row global map.
+4. The sealed controls reproduce `40/0` and the selftest `50/0`.  The three
+   requested positive controls pass identically, hence at every charged
+   junction order, with one common additive parameter before gauge fixing.
+   The target-independent bad `g` fails at `t^1`.  A Galois-covariant
+   one-parameter mutation of the cubic root tails fails the polynomial-input
+   guard at `t^1`; saturation at the mutation parameter gives the unit ideal.
+
+For every requested `(group,k,UNI/SPLIT)` row the only licensed target verdict
+is `COUNTING-BOUND`.  No row earns `RANK-EXCESS`, `SATURATED-EMPTY`, or
+`SURVIVES-TO-Q`, because no complete target system was emitted.  Consequently
+there is **no D=105 kill and no change to `D_min`** in this lane.
+
+## 1. Custody and hash gate
+
+The mandatory gate was run before opening any frozen input.  All eight hashes
+matched exactly:
+
+```text
