+|---|---:|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| A | 12 | assumed one disc orbit; permutation/route missing | no supplied split | not computed | not computed | not computed | not computed | not formed | `COUNTING-BOUND` |
+| A | 14 | assumed one disc orbit; permutation/route missing | no supplied split | not computed | not computed | not computed | not computed | not formed | `COUNTING-BOUND` |
