+
+OPEN
+  Every requested UNI and SPLIT decoration; the route from local cover factors
+  to physical discs/branches; first global order; formula-(4.13) unknowns;
+  formula-(4.11) equations; global rank/cokernel; target saturation.
+
+CONTROLS
+  sealed 40/0 and selftest 50/0; three exact positives SURVIVE-TO-Q at all
+  listed orders with one common constant before gauge; bad g fails at t^1;
+  one cubic tame mutation fails at t^1 and is empty after saturation at a.
+
+NOT CLAIMED
+  A global interpolation matrix for any true D=105 group; any RANK-EXCESS;
+  any target SATURATED-EMPTY; any target SURVIVES-TO-Q; any D=105 kill;
+  D_min>=108.
+```

