+The requested global ranks, cokernels, and saturated ideals are **not defined
+by the charged inputs**.  I therefore do not report a fabricated rank for any
+of the three true `D=105` groups.
+
+The obstruction is concrete.  Section 4.1 of the sealed framework requires a
+rooted tree on all 105 labelled roots, a checked cyclic action on those roots,
+every root's truncated Puiseux series, the sharing relations among tame
+coefficients, and a precision guard.  The census supplies a representative
+Moh chain and a capacity for bottom discs.  The reviewed star supplies the
+three relative leading coefficients `{-1,0,1}` inside one bottom disc.  It does
+not supply the other roots, the disc centres, their contacts, their tail
+support, or their sharing.  Those missing quantities occur in the first
+global moment matrix itself.
