+```text
+tau_(j,c)(z)
+ = w_<delta2(zeta^j z)
+   + b zeta^(r_2 j) z^r_2
+   + c zeta^(r_1 j) z^r_1
+   + higher,
+
+j mod A_2,    c in {-1,0,+1}.
+```
+
+The three substitutions are:
