+root series.  Consequently **all nine UNI decorations remain open inputs**.
+The coincidences `k=A_2` in A/18, B/13, and C/17 are suggestive numerical
+compatibilities only; matching cardinalities do not give a map from cover
+factors to discs.
+
+There is no second, canonically “coarsest” several-orbit decoration in the
+charged data.  The maximal-free-orbit decomposition of the scalar level
+polynomial permits the numerical patterns
